# Phase 11: event queues: a server blocked in event_wait uses no CPU while
# idle and wakes within 1 ms of a message; timers, the peer closing and a
# child's exit arrive as events.
cerberus kernel shell
!send run /bin/eventtest
!wait 30
a timeout and a one-shot timer were both on time
during a 1 s event_wait the
woke
the peer closing and the child exiting both arrived as events
eventtest: PASS
run: /bin/eventtest exited with status 0
